#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:11 templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:11 templates/components/modal-second-pillar-payment-rate.php:11
msgid "How does the calculator work?"
msgstr "Kuidas pensionikalkulaator töötab?"

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:16
msgid "The world's leading analysts have determined that fees are the surest predictor of returns: the lower the fees, the better prospects for growth. (And higher fees correlate with poorer results.)"
msgstr "Maailma juhtivad analüütikud on leidnud, et fondi kulud on ainus tõsiseltvõetav näitaja, millel on pikaajaline seos fondi tulemustega. Mida madalamad kulud, seda paremad eeldused vara kasvuks. Ja vastupidi: mida kõrgemad kulud, seda kehvem oodatav tulemus."

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:17
msgid "Expected returns depend greatly on the evolving rate of return, and neither we nor anyone else are able to guarantee a 5% annual return."
msgstr "Oodatav summa sõltub tegelikult kujunevast tootluse määrast ja meie ega keegi teine ei saa sulle tagada, et fondide tootlus on 5% aastas."

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:18
msgid "In a low-cost index fund your assets grow hand-in-hand with the average returns of world markets. Low-cost index funds have outperformed Estonian pension funds every year to date, but past performance is no guarantee of future performance."
msgstr "Madala kuluga indeksifondis käib sinu vara kasv käsikäes maailmaturgude keskmisega. Seni on see olnud märkimisväärselt parem Eesti pankade pensionifondide pikaajalisest tootlusest, aga minevik pole tuleviku garantiiks."

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:21 templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:20 templates/components/modal-second-pillar-payment-rate.php:20
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "Mudeli eeldused"

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:24
msgid "Funds' average annual return before management fees"
msgstr "Pensionifondide keskmine aastatootlus enne fondi kulude mahaarvamist"

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:28
msgid "Average annual salary growth"
msgstr "Palgakasv aastas"

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:32
msgid "Minimum eligible age"
msgstr "Pensionikogumise alustamise vanus"

#: templates/components/modal-calculator.php:33
msgid "21yrs"
msgstr "21a"

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:24
msgid "Tõnu Pekk is an investor with 30 years of experience, a good deal of it from the international financial sector. Having led development projects and managed investments, he is currently fund manager at Tuleva."
msgstr "Tõnu Pekk on 30-aastase kogemusega investor. Tõnu omab rahvusvahelist kogemust finantssektorist, on vedanud arendusprojekte ning juhtinud investeeringuid. Praegu on ta Tuleva fondijuht."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:34
msgid "Priit Lepasepp's everyday work is aimed at increasing renewable energy generation, and he also serves as one of Tuleva’s legal advisers."
msgstr "Priit Lepasepp tegeleb igapäevaselt sellega, et aidata suurendada taastuvenergia tootmist. Lisaks on ta ka üks Tuleva juriidilistest nõustajatest."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:44
msgid "Indrek Neivelt is the founder of Pocopay. He has been in a leading role at Hansabank and other large financial institutions in previous decades, and is now putting his knowledge to work for developing better, simpler payment solutions."
msgstr "Indrek Neivelt on Pocopay asutaja. Indrek on olnud juhtivrollis Hansapangas ja teistes suurtes finantsinstitutsioonides ning kasutab nüüd oma teadmisi paremate ja lihtsamate makselahenduste loomiseks."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:54
msgid "Daniel Vaarik has dedicated his career to ensuring that people get clearer and better information they need for making important decisions. He is currently a partner at Akkadian communication agency."
msgstr "Daniel on pühendanud oma karjääri sellele, et inimesteni jõuaksid paremad ja selgemad sõnumid, mille põhjal olulisi otsuseid teha. Täna tegutseb ta partnerina sõnumiagentuuris Akkadian."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:64
msgid "Kristo Käärmann is a co-founder of Wise. Having witnessed inefficiency in the financial sector, Kristo is helping to lead a revolution in the way money is moved, making currency exchange easier, clearer and more transparent all around the world."
msgstr "Kristo Käärmann on Wise’i asutaja. Olles näinud ebaefektiivsust finantssektoris, aitab Kristo teha revolutsiooni raha liikumises, tehes valuutavahetust üle maailma lihtsamaks, selgemaks ja läbipaistvamaks."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:74
msgid "Mall Hellam is the director of Open Estonia Fund. Mall’s activities are aimed toward making Estonia more open and tolerant, fostering serious discussion on key questions and building a robust civil society."
msgstr "Mall Hellam juhib Avatud Eesti Fondi. Mall keskendub oma tegevuses sellele, et Eesti oleks rohkem avatud ja salliv, et ühiskonnas toimuks sisuline debatt oluliste küsimuste üle ning et meil oleks tõeliselt tugev kodanikuühiskond."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:84
msgid "Kirsti Pent is a partner with FORT law offices. Kirsti specializes in financial regulations, helping clients develop clear, specific solutions for financial transactions. She is also one of Tuleva’s legal advisers."
msgstr "Kirsti Pent on partner FORT advokaadibüroos. Kirsti on spetsialiseerunud finantsvaldkonna regulatsioonidele, aidates kliente selgete ja korrektsete lahendustega finantstehingutes ning on ka üks Tuleva juriidilistest nõustajatest."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:94
msgid "Indrek Kasela is an entrepreneur and investor. Indrek has longstanding experience in large corporations and has also been busy developing the cultural sphere."
msgstr "Indrek Kasela on ettevõtja ja investor. Indrek omab pikaajalist ettevõtluskogemust suurettevõtetest ning on lisaks sellele tegus ka kultuurivaldkonna arendamises."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:104
msgid "Annika Uudelepp is a civil society and governance expert with the Praxis think tank, and has long been spotlighting and helping to address issues of concern in Estonian society."
msgstr "Annika Uudelepp on kodanikuühiskonna ja riigivalitsemise ekspert Praxise mõttekojas. Ta on pikaajaliselt juhtinud tähelepanu murekohtadele Eesti ühiskonnas ning aidanud neile lahendusi leida."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:114
msgid "Henrik Karmo is an investor with a broad set of experiences in building various investment companies and developing investment strategies."
msgstr "Henrik Karmo tegutseb igapäevaselt investorina. Henrikul on laiapõhjaline kogemus erinevate investeerimisettevõtete üles ehitamisel ja investeerimisstrateegiate loomisel."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:124
msgid "Taavi Lepmets is an investor. Since the 1990s, Taavi has been investing into early-phase technologies, and is still on the lookout for new avenues today. "
msgstr "Taavi Lepmets tegutseb investorina. Taavi on omandanud kogemusi varajases faasis tehnoloogia investeeringute tegemisel alates eelmisest sajandist, ning üritab selles vallas uusi elamusi otsida ka tänapäeval."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:134
msgid "Taavet Hinrikus is a co-founder of Wise. Taavet believes in simple, clear and transparent solutions and is helping to make money transfers and currency exchange easier and more convenient for everyone."
msgstr "Taavet Hinrikus on Wise’i asutaja. Taavet usub lihtsatesse, selgetesse ja läbipaistvatesse lahendustesse, ning aitab igapäevaselt muuta raha liikumist ja valuutavahetust kõikidele paremaks ja mugavamaks."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:144
msgid "Loit Linnupõld is the founder of Crowdestate. Boasting longstanding experiences in the financial sector, he is helping to bring investors and real estate developers together to develop Estonian investor culture and develop access to capital."
msgstr "Loit Linnupõld on Crowdestate’i asutaja. Loit omab pikaajalist kogemust finantssektoris ning aitab läbi ühisrahastuse viia kokku investoreid ning kinnisvaraarendajaid, et selle läbi arendada eesti investorkultuuri ja arendada ligipääsu kapitalile."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:154
msgid "Veljo Otsason is a co-founder of Fortumo and Mobi and an angel investor in more than 15 companies. Veljo’s passion is new technologies: his companies help create better wireless services and payment and authentication systems. "
msgstr "Veljo Otsason on Fortumo ja Mobi kaasasutaja ning ingelinvestor rohkem kui 15 ettevõttes. Veljo kireks on uued tehnoloogilised lahendused, ning tema ettevõtted aitavad luua paremaid mobiilseid teenuseid, nii maksesüsteeme kui autentimist."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:164
msgid "Rain Rannu is a technology entrepreneur and investor, and a founder of Fortumo and Mobi. Rain’s passion is enterprise and developing new ideas, and likes projects that would not exist without him."
msgstr "Rain Rannu on tehnoloogiaettevõtja ja investor, Fortumo ja Mobi asutaja. Raini kireks on ettevõtlus ja uute ideede välja töötamine, talle meeldivad projektid, mida ilma temata ei oleks."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:174
msgid "Sandor Liive’s passion lies in the energy sector. Sandor served as CEO of the state energy company Eesti Energia for many years and now is engaged in developing new solutions in the energy sector."
msgstr "Sandor Liive kirg on energiasektoris. Sandor on pikaajaliselt juhtinud Eesti Energiat ning tegeleb uute lahenduste toomisega energiasektorisse."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:184
msgid "Heikko Mäe is an auditor with a passion for getting things done in a meticulous manner. Heikko shared his knowledge and experience in creating Tuleva funds"
msgstr "Heikko Mäe on audiitor. Tema kireks on, et asjad saaksid tehtud õigesti ja täpselt. Heikko jagas oma teadmisi ja kogemusi Tuleva fondide loomisel"

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:194
msgid "Gerd Laub is a legal adviser at Funderbeam. With a background in law, he specializes in providing consultation to financial companies and helps to solve complicated problems in the financial technology sector."
msgstr "Gerd Laub on Funderbeami juriidiline nõustaja. Gerdi taust on õiguse valdkonnas, ta on spetsialiseerunud finantsettevõtete nõustamisele ning aitab lahendada keerukaid probleeme finantstehnoloogia vallas."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:204
msgid "Triinu Tombak provides financial and business advisory services. She currently serves on the supervisory boards of the power utility AS Harju Elekter and the think tank Praxis."
msgstr "Triinu Tombak tegeleb finants- ja ärinõustamisega. Praegusel hetkel võib teda leida AS-i Harju Elekter nõukogust ning mõttekoja Praxis nõukogust."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:214
msgid "Kadi Lambot is a doctor who has served as CEO of a number of large enterprises. Kadi believes that the medical system needs comprehensive, user-friendly solutions and works to that end as member of the supervisory board of the Cancer Society, Healthy Estonia Foundation, and Tartu University Foundation."
msgstr "Kadi Lambot on arst, kes on olnud mitmete suurettevõtete juht. Kadi usub, et meditsiinisüsteem vajab terviklikke ning kliendisõbralikke lahendusi ning töötab selle nimel olles Vähiliidu, Terve Eesti SA, Tartu Ülikooli SA nõukogu liige."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:224
msgid "Allan Kaldoja is an entrepreneur. His passion is developing CSOs. As supervisory board chairman, he was instrumental in getting SA Vaba Lava (Open Stage Foundation) off the ground."
msgstr "Allan Kaldoja tegeleb ettevõtlusega. Allani kireks on kodanikuühenduste arendamine, olles aidanud käivitada nõukogu esimehena SA Vaba Lava."

#: templates/components/modal-founders.php:234
msgid "Jaak Roosaare is an investor and the author of Rikkaks Saamise Õpik, which translates as a primer on how to get rich. Jaak devotes his time to making Estonians financially savvier, so they could make better financial decisions and enjoy a better life."
msgstr "Jaak Roosaare on investor ja Rikkaks Saamise Õpiku autor. Jaak pühendab oma aega sellele, et arendada eestlaste finantsteadlikkust, et inimesed teeksid paremaid finantsotsuseid ja läbi selle saaksid nautida paremat elu."

#: templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:16 templates/components/modal-second-pillar-payment-rate.php:16
msgid "Expected returns depend greatly on the evolving rate of return, and neither we nor anyone else are able to guarantee a 7% annual return."
msgstr "Oodatav summa sõltub tegelikult kujunevast tootluse määrast ja meie ega keegi teine ei saa sulle tagada fondide tootlust."

#: templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:17
msgid "In 2026, income tax rate is 22% and everyone has a flat tax-free income of 700 euros per month (8400 euros per year)."
msgstr "Alates 2026. aastast on kõigil ühtlane maksuvaba tulu 700 € kuus (8400 € aastas), olenemata kogutulust."

#: templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:23
msgid "2026 income tax rate"
msgstr "2026. a tulumaksumäär"

#: templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:27
msgid "2026 basic exemption per month"
msgstr "2026. a maksuvaba tulu kuus"

#: templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:31 templates/components/modal-second-pillar-payment-rate.php:31
msgid "Retirement age"
msgstr "Pensioniiga"

#: templates/components/modal-payout-calculator.php:32 templates/components/modal-second-pillar-payment-rate.php:32
msgid "65 y/o"
msgstr "65 a"

#: templates/components/modal-question-fee.php:12
msgid "How do we use membership fees?"
msgstr "Milleks me liitumistasu kasutame?"

#: templates/components/modal-question-fee.php:14
msgid "Membership fees are used to develop the Association and to represent the interests of members. The fees of our first members were used to raise the fund's initial capital, introduce Tuleva to the general public, and make preparations to start the fund, including application for an activity license from the Financial Inspectorate. From this point forward, membership fees will be used for the following activities:"
msgstr "Liitumistasusid kasutame meie ühise ettevõtte arenduseks ja liikmete huvide eest seismiseks. Esimeste liikmete tasudest tegime vajalikud kulutused, et koguda Tuleva algkapital, tutvustada Tulevat laiemale avalikkusele ning ette valmistada kõik vajalik meie ühise fondivalitseja käivitamiseks ja Finantsinspektsioonilt tegevusloa taotluseks. Edasi katame liikmetasudest kulud järgmisteks tegevusteks:"

#: templates/components/modal-question-fee.php:15
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Membership community management and communication</li>\n"
"                            <li>Development of Tuleva’s web page, blog, and other informational channels</li>\n"
"                            <li>The creation of proposals and influence analysis to improve the Estonian pension system, in cooperation with the Ministry of Finance and other state organizations</li>\n"
"                            <li>Development of Tuleva’s IT systems</li>\n"
"                            <li>Preparation and analysis of voluntary savings products and Third Pillar options</li>\n"
"                        </ul>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Liikmehaldus ja -teavitus</li>\n"
"                            <li>Tuleva veebilehe, blogi ja teiste infokanalite arendus</li>\n"
"                            <li>Ettepanekute väljatöötamine ja mõjuanalüüsid Eesti pensionisüsteemi paremaks muutmiseks, koostöö rahandusministeeriumi ja teiste riigiasutustega</li>\n"
"                            <li>Tuleva IT-süsteemide arendus</li>\n"
"                            <li>Vabatahtliku pensionifondi ja muude pikaajalise investeerimise toodete analüüs ja ettevalmistus.</li>\n"
"                        </ul>"

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:12
msgid "Your joining fee helps to bring well thought ideas with big impact to decision-makers."
msgstr "Sinu liitumistasu aitab läbimõeldud, suure mõjuga ideed otsustajateni viia."

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:14
msgid "Every euro saved gives a Swede almost a third higher pension than the same amount saved by Estonians. Estonia needs a smarter and measurable pension strategy."
msgstr "Iga säästetud euro annab Rootsi inimestele umbes kolmandiku võrra rohkem pensionit kui sama raha meie inimestele. Eesti vajab targemat, mõõdetavate eesmärkidega pensionistrateegiat."

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:16
msgid "As the first and only association representing pension savers, Tuleva is a credible partner for Ministry of Finance and state legislative bodies. We participate in pension strategy discussions, where next to the officials only banks and insurance companies used to be represented."
msgstr "Laua taga, kus varem oli lisaks ametnikele ja poliitikutele kohta vaid pankade ja kindlustusseltside esindajatel, on Tuleva Eesti esimese pensionikogujate ühendusena tõsiseks partneriks nii Rahandusministeeriumile kui teistele riigiasutustele."

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:18
msgid "<span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">We help to make better laws</span>. The laws that protect the people. The laws that maximize our profits from our, not banks’ savings."
msgstr "<span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">Aitame teha seadused paremaks</span>, et need kaitseks eelkõige meie, inimeste huve. Et igast täna säästetud eurost saaksime tulevikus maksimaalse kasu meie ise, mitte pankade omanikud."

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:20
msgid "We have our first achievements. For example"
msgstr "Esimesed võidud on käes. Näiteks:"

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:23
msgid "On Tuleva’s initiative, <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">people in Estonia saved only during last year 1.5 million euros</span>, because the fund managers are no longer allowed to charge high fees for changing the pension fund."
msgstr "<span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">Eesti inimesed hoidsid ainuüksi eelmisel kahel aastal kokku 1,5 miljonit eurot</span>, sest Tuleva ettepanekul keelas riik fondivalitsejatel võtta inimestelt pensionifondi vahetamise eest kõrget tasu."

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:24
msgid "<span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">We sent a petition to parliament, signed by 2300 people</span>, that proposes to reform how people can use their II pillar savings."
msgstr "<span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">Saatsime 2300 allkirjaga riigikokku ettepaneku reformida teise pensionisamba väljamaksed</span>, et inimesed saaksid raha kasutada väiksemate kuludega ja tegelikest vajadustest lähtuvalt."

#: templates/components/modal-question-joining-fee.php:27
msgid "We do not organise demonstrations or spread random complaints. We are direct, we analyse issues and offer constructive solutions."
msgstr "Me ei korralda pikette ega loobi tühja kriitikat. Oleme otsekohesed, analüüsime probleeme ja pakume konstruktiivseid lahendusi."

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:12
msgid "Tuleva is a social company with a goal to earn profit for its members."
msgstr "Tuleva on sotsiaalne ettevõte, mille eesmärk on teenida liikmetele tulu."

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:14
msgid "Tuleva’s main principle is that people themselves save money for their future, using contemporary technologies and bypassing unnecessary middlemen and costs as much as possible."
msgstr "Tuleva idee on, et inimesed ise koguvad koos oma tuleviku jaoks raha, kasutades kaasaegseid tehnoloogiaid ja jättes kõrvale nii palju vahemehi ning lisakulusid kui võimalik."

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:16
msgid "Every year, each member who has transferred their II pillar to Tuleva pension funds, earns a <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">member bonus</span>. Member bonus is very small at first, but it will grow together with member’s pension assets. Bonus is transferred to your personal capital account at Tuleva. This is your ownership stake in Tuleva capital and this stake can earn you additional profit."
msgstr "Igal aastal <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">arvestame liikmeboonust kõigile liikmetele</span>, kes on oma II samba vara toonud Tuleva pensionifondi. Liikmeboonus on algul hästi tilluke, aga kasvab koos pensionivara kasvuga. Boonus kantakse sinu isiklikule kapitalikontole Tulevas. Sellega kasvab sinu osalus Tuleva omakapitalis ja see osalus teenib omakorda tulu."

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:18
msgid "When Tuleva grows, our funds under management grow and we add new products to our offering, then the association will earn profit. <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">The profit is then divided among members</span>, as set in our Articles of Association."
msgstr "Kui Tuleva areneb, meie fondide maht kasvab ja loome uusi investeerimistooteid, teenib ühistu kasumit ja <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">kasumi jagame liikmete vahel</span>, nii nagu põhikirjas kokku lepitud."

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:20
msgid "As always with profit from entrepreneurship - this depends how well our venture is doing. The founders are convinced, that the <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">100-euro joining fee pays for itself many times over</span>. But we do not give promises."
msgstr "Nagu ettevõtlustuluga ikka – see sõltub sellest, kui hästi meie ühisel ettevõttel läheb. Tuleva asutajad on ise veendunud, et <span class=\"text-highlight text-bold\">100 euro suurune liitumistasu tasub ennast kuhjaga</span> – aga lubadustest hoidume."

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:22
msgid "How is member bonus calculated?"
msgstr "Kuidas liikmeboonust arvutatakse?"

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:24
msgid "At the end of each year"
msgstr "Aasta lõppedes"

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:27
msgid "We calculate how many pension fund units each member had on average during the year in euros"
msgstr "arvutame, kui palju oli igal Tuleva liikmel möödunud aasta jooksul keskmiselt Tuleva pensionifondide osakuid;"

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:28
msgid "Multiply this by 0,05% and transfer the resulting amount to member’s capital account"
msgstr "korrutame selle 0,05%-ga ja kanname tulemuseks saadud summa tema liikmekapitali kontole;"

#: templates/components/modal-question-profit.php:29
msgid "Every 5 years, members annual meeting decides whether to pay our accumulated profit as a dividend or keep it invested."
msgstr "iga 5 aasta tagant otsustavad Tuleva liikmed üldkoosolekul, kas maksta kapitalikontodele kogunenud kasum välja või hoida see edasi investeerituna."

#: templates/components/modal-question-rights.php:12
msgid "What are your rights and obligations as a Tuleva member?"
msgstr "Mis on Tuleva liikmete põhikirjalised õigused ja kohustused?"

#: templates/components/modal-question-rights.php:14
msgid "Every member has the right to:"
msgstr "Igal ühistu liikmel on õigus:"

#: templates/components/modal-question-rights.php:15
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Have access to important documentation pertaining to all activities of the association</li>\n"
"                            <li>Participate in the general assembly and other Tuleva events</li>\n"
"                            <li>Elect Tuleva management and apply for management positions</li>\n"
"                            <li>Participate in Tuleva’s profit sharing based on predetermined rules</li>\n"
"                            <li>Use Tuleva’s services and participate in members’ information sharing (for example via e-mail or in our closed Facebook group)</li>\n"
"                            <li>Leave the association (after 5 years of membership have passed)</li>\n"
"                            <li>Leave their assets as an inheritance to their designated heir</li>\n"
"                        </ul>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>tutvuda Tuleva põhikirja ja teiste oluliste dokumentidega ning saada teavet ühistu tegevuse tulemuste ja plaanide kohta</li>\n"
"                            <li>osaleda üldkoosolekul ja muudel Tuleva üritustel</li>\n"
"                            <li>valida Tuleva juhtimis- ja kontrollorganeid ning neisse kandideerida</li>\n"
"                            <li>osaleda Tuleva kasumi jaotamisel vastavalt põhikirjas kokku lepitule</li>\n"
"                            <li>kasutada Tuleva teenuseid ja osaleda liikmete infovahetuses (näiteks e-mailitsi ja Tuleva liikmete kinnises facebook-i grupis)</li>\n"
"                            <li>astuda ühistust välja (5 aasta möödumisel liikmeks astumisest)</li>\n"
"                            <li>pärandada surma korral ühistusse kogunenud vara</li>\n"
"                        </ul>"

#: templates/components/modal-question-rights.php:25
msgid "Every member has the obligation to:"
msgstr "Tuleva liige kohustub:"

#: templates/components/modal-question-rights.php:26
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Comply with laws and follow the decisions made by Tuleva’s managerial board</li>\n"
"                            <li>Pay a one-time membership fee</li>\n"
"                            <li>Keep Tuleva’s business secrets</li>\n"
"                            <li>Pay additional fees if decided so by the general assembly*</li>\n"
"                        </ul>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
