#: templates/child-savings-content.php:79
msgid "If you have several children, you can open a separate account for each one."
msgstr "Kui sul on mitu last, saad avada igale ühele oma konto."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:94
msgid "Coming this autumn"
msgstr "Tuleb sügisel"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:95
msgid "Gifts straight to your child's account"
msgstr "Kingitused otse lapse kontole"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:96
msgid "Grandparents, godparents, and friends will be able to make contributions straight to your child's savings fund account, with no steps in between."
msgstr "Vanavanemad, ristivanemad ja sõbrad saavad teha sissemakseid otse lapse kogumisfondi kontole, ilma vahesammudeta."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:108 templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:182
msgid "Good to know before you start"
msgstr "Hea teada enne alustamist"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:110
msgid "Before investing for your child, save for yourself."
msgstr "Enne lapsele investeerimist kogu endale."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:112
#, php-format
msgid "The greatest gift to a child is a parent who has taken care of their own future: second and third pillar tax benefits used and a rainy-day fund in place. %s"
msgstr "Lapsele on kõige suurem kingitus vanem, kes on enda tuleviku eest hoolitsenud: II ja III samba maksusoodustus kasutatud ja meelerahufond olemas. %s"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:113
msgid "Why take care of your own third pillar first? →"
msgstr "Miks võiks kõigepealt hoolitseda oma III samba eest? →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:115
msgid "Money given to your child stays with your child."
msgstr "Lapsele antud raha jääb lapsele."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:116
msgid "The assets belong to the child and withdrawals can only be made to the child's own bank account. This gives the assets reasonable protection."
msgstr "Vara on lapse oma ja väljamakseid saab teha ainult lapse enda pangakontole. See annab varale mõistliku kaitse."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:117 templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:184
msgid "Stock markets fluctuate."
msgstr "Aktsiaturud kõiguvad."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:118
msgid "Stock prices can rise as well as fall over time. The fund is meant for long-term investing – and saving for a child usually is just that. Still, returns cannot be guaranteed."
msgstr "Aktsiate hinnad võivad ajas nii kasvada kui ka kahaneda. Fond sobib pikaajaliseks investeerimiseks – ja lapsele kogumine seda enamasti ongi. Tootlust ei saa siiski garanteerida."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:119
msgid "The fund's assets are protected."
msgstr "Fondi vara on kaitstud."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:120
msgid "The fund's assets are held strictly separate from Tuleva's assets at an independent depositary, and Tuleva Fondid AS operates under the supervision of the Estonian Financial Supervision Authority."
msgstr "Fondi vara hoitakse Tuleva varast rangelt lahus sõltumatus depositooriumis ja Tuleva Fondid AS tegutseb Finantsinspektsiooni järelevalve all."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:132
msgid "Start today"
msgstr "Alusta juba täna"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:133
msgid "Open an account in just a couple of minutes. The earlier you start, the longer your child's assets have to grow."
msgstr "Ava konto vaid paari minutiga. Mida varem alustad, seda kauem jõuab lapse vara kasvada."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:136
msgid "Over <strong>85,000</strong> people save with Tuleva"
msgstr "Üle <strong>85 000</strong> inimese kogub Tulevas"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:137 templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:208
msgid "Fee <strong>0.28%</strong> per year, no extra charges"
msgstr "Tasu <strong>0,28%</strong> aastas, lisatasudeta"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:153
msgid "Why open an Additional Investment Fund for your child rather than a third pillar?"
msgstr "Miks avada lapsele Täiendav Kogumisfond, mitte III sammas?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:155
msgid "The third pillar's appeal is the tax benefit: you get income tax back on your contributions. But only a person who earns taxable income themselves gets the refund. A child usually doesn't, so paying into a child's third pillar creates no tax benefit."
msgstr "III samba võlu on maksuvõit: sissemaksetelt saab tulumaksu tagasi. Aga tagastust saab ainult inimene, kes ise teenib maksustatavat tulu. Laps üldjuhul ei teeni, seega lapse III sambasse makstes maksuvõitu ei teki."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:160
msgid "Read more →"
msgstr "Loe lähemalt →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:165
msgid "What happens if my child withdraws all the money at 18?"
msgstr "Mis saab, kui laps võtab 18-aastaselt kogu raha välja?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:167
msgid "At 18, the decision does indeed pass to your child, because the assets are theirs. In practice, this fear is usually bigger than the actual risk: a young person who has watched their money grow for years treats it as their future assets, not as a windfall."
msgstr "Otsustusõigus läheb 18-aastaselt tõesti lapsele, sest vara on tema oma. Praktikas on see hirm enamasti suurem kui tegelik risk: noor, kes on oma raha kasvamist aastaid näinud, võtab seda kui oma tulevikuvara, mitte kui ootamatut võitu."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:168
msgid "What helps most is involving your child in saving early on: show them how the account grows and talk about what you are saving for. That way the money won't come as a surprise at 18."
msgstr "Kõige rohkem aitab, kui kaasad lapse kogumisse varakult: näita talle, kuidas konto kasvab, ja rääkige, milleks te kogute. Nii ei tule raha talle 18-aastaselt üllatusena."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:169
msgid "Experience elsewhere shows the same: data on the UK's similar product (the Junior ISA) shows that only 6.5% of young people withdrew the whole amount right at 18 (AJ Bell, 2026)."
msgstr "Sama näitab kogemus mujalt: Suurbritannia sarnase toote (Junior ISA) andmetel võttis kogu summa 18-aastaselt kohe välja vaid 6,5% noortest (AJ Bell, 2026)."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:173
msgid "How does this differ from LHV's Kasvukonto and Swedbank's child products?"
msgstr "Kuidas see erineb LHV Kasvukontost ja Swedbanki lapsetoodetest?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:177
msgid "Read more: 3 reasons to avoid child-labeled savings products"
msgstr "Loe lähemalt: 3 põhjust, miks vältida lapse-sildiga kogumistooteid"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:181
msgid "How do I make contributions?"
msgstr "Kuidas teha sissemakseid?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:183
msgid "You can make contributions to your child's savings fund account both from your own bank account and from the child's. We have confirmed with the Estonian Tax and Customs Board that in both cases your child gets an acquisition cost for the units, and in the future only the gain is taxed on sale, not the whole amount."
msgstr "Sissemakseid lapse kogumisfondi kontole saad teha nii enda kui lapse kontolt. Oleme kinnitanud Maksu- ja Tolliametiga üle, et mõlemal juhul tekib lapsel osakute soetusmaksumus ja tulevikus maksustatakse müügil ainult kasum, mitte kogu summa."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:190
msgid "How do withdrawals work?"
msgstr "Kuidas raha välja saab?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:192
msgid "Units can be sold at any time and the money is paid only to your child's own bank account. This keeps your child's assets protected: money cannot move to anyone else's account."
msgstr "Osakuid saab müüa igal ajal ja raha laekub ainult lapse enda pangakontole. Nii on lapse vara kaitstud: raha ei saa liikuda kellegi teise kontole."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:193
msgid "Units bought with the money you contributed yourself can be sold by you as your child's representative without extra conditions. If units were bought with the child's other money (for example a gift or an inheritance received straight to the child's account), the sale requires the court's consent by law. You can ask the court for a general consent covering the whole childhood. The state fee is 10 €."
msgstr "Sinu enda sissemakstud raha eest ostetud osakuid saad lapse esindajana müüa ilma lisatingimusteta. Kui osakud on ostetud lapse muu raha eest (näiteks otse lapse kontole laekunud kingitus või pärandus), vajab müük seaduse järgi kohtu nõusolekut. Kohtult saab küsida üldnõusoleku kogu lapsepõlveks. Riigilõiv on 10 €."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:195
#, php-format
msgid "The state is preparing a legislative change that would make investing in a child's name even simpler. %s"
msgstr "Riik valmistab ette seadusemuudatust, mis muudaks lapse nimel investeerimise veel lihtsamaks. %s"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:196
msgid "We wrote about it on the blog →"
msgstr "Kirjutasime sellest blogis →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:201
msgid "Do I have to file a tax return in my child's name?"
msgstr "Kas pean tegema lapse nimel tuludeklaratsiooni?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:203
msgid "It depends on whether you make contributions from a regular bank account or through an investment account."
msgstr "See sõltub sellest, kas teed sissemakseid tavakontolt või investeerimiskonto kaudu."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:204
msgid "<b>Making contributions from a regular bank account</b>, you don't need to open a separate investment account for your child or file a tax return for them every spring. A tax return has to be filed in the child's name only when units are sold at a gain. Only the gain is taxed, and your child can use their own tax-free income, which today is 8,400 € per year. Selling units spread over several years, there may be no income tax at all."
msgstr "<b>Tehes sissemakseid tavakontolt</b> ei pea avama lapsele eraldi investeerimiskontot ega täitma igal kevadel lapse deklaratsiooni. Tuludeklaratsioon tuleb lapse nimel esitada alles siis, kui osakud müüakse kasumiga. Maksustatakse ainult kasum ja laps saab kasutada oma maksuvaba tulu, mis on täna 8400 € aastas. Müües osakuid hajutatult mitme aasta peale, ei pruugi tulumaksu üldse tekkida."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:205
msgid "<b>Making contributions from an investment account</b>, a tax return has to be filed in the child's name every spring. You declare the difference between the money paid into the investment account and the money paid out of it. Contributions to the savings fund are marked neutral if you haven't sold any units in the same year. As the fund started in 2026, the first tax return is due in the spring of 2027 – by then we will have guides that make it as simple as possible for you."
msgstr "<b>Tehes sissemakseid investeerimiskontolt</b> tuleb lapse nimel esitada deklaratsioon igal kevadel. Deklareerid investeerimiskontole sissemakstud ja sealt väljamakstud raha vahe. Sissemaksed kogumisfondi märgid neutraalseks, kui sa pole samal aastal osakuid müünud. Kuna fond alustas 2026. aastal, tuleb esimene deklaratsioon esitada 2027. aasta kevadel – selleks ajaks teeme juhised, mis muudavad selle sulle võimalikult lihtsaks."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:206
msgid "Read on the blog which approach suits your family →"
msgstr "Kumb lähenemine sinu perele sobib, loe blogist →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:212
msgid "My child already has a third pillar with Tuleva. What should I do now?"
msgstr "Lapsel on juba Tulevas III&nbsp;sammas. Mida nüüd teha?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:214
msgid "A child's third pillar doesn't give an income tax refund, because a child generally doesn't earn enough income. That's why it's worth directing new contributions to your child's Additional Investment Fund; what's already saved keeps growing in the third pillar."
msgstr "Lapse III&nbsp;sammas ei anna tulumaksutagastust, sest laps ei teeni üldiselt piisavalt tulu. Seepärast tasub uued sissemaksed suunata lapse Täiendavasse Kogumisfondi, seni kogutu kasvab III&nbsp;sambas edasi."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:222 templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:362
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Uuri rohkem"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:236
msgid "More about the Tuleva Additional Investment Fund →"
msgstr "Tuleva Täiendavast Kogumisfondist lähemalt →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:237
msgid "Fund documents →"
msgstr "Fondi dokumendid →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:19
msgid "Child's age"
msgstr "Lapse vanus"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:45
msgid "Tax win"
msgstr "Maksuvõit"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:227 templates/child-savings-content.php:232
msgid "Read on →"
msgstr "Loe edasi →"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:230
msgid "Do you need an investment account when saving for a child?"
msgstr "Kas lapsele kogudes on vaja investeerimiskontot?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:231
msgid "Two approaches to choose between."
msgstr "Kaks lähenemist, mille vahel valida."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:51 templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:379
msgid "Opening an account is free and takes only a few minutes."
msgstr "Konto avamine on tasuta ja võtab vaid mõne minuti."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:156
msgid "Second, the third pillar is meant for retirement: with the favorable tax rate, the money only becomes available close to retirement age. For a child, this would mean locking the money away for decades. From the Additional Investment Fund, your child can use the money when they need it, for example for education or a first home."
msgstr "Teiseks on III sammas mõeldud pensioniks: soodsa maksumääraga saab raha kätte alles pensioniea lähedal. Lapse jaoks tähendaks see raha lukustamist aastakümneteks. Täiendavast Kogumisfondist saab laps raha kasutada siis, kui tal seda vaja on – näiteks hariduseks või esimese kodu jaoks."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:157
msgid "Saving in the child's name in the Additional Investment Fund, the tax win comes from the other end: when selling units, the child can use their yearly tax-free income, which today is 8,400 € per year."
msgstr "Lapse nimel Kogumisfondis kogudes tuleb maksuvõit teisest otsast: osakuid müües saab laps kasutada oma maksuvaba tulu, mis täna on 8400 € aastas."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:159
#, php-format
msgid "Once your child starts earning income themselves, they should consider their own third pillar too, because then they get a tax benefit as well. If your child already has a third pillar account opened before 2021, keep it as it is: these are separate accounts and don't mix. And your own third pillar is worth filling before you start saving for your child. %s"
msgstr "Kui laps hakkab ise tulu teenima, tasub tal kaaluda ka oma III sammast – siis tekib maksuvõit temalgi. Kui lapsel on juba varasemast, enne 2021. aastat avatud III samba konto, säilita see nii, nagu on – need on eraldi kontod ega segune. Ja sinu enda III sammas tasub täita enne, kui lapsele koguma hakkad. %s"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:175
msgid "LHV's Kasvukonto is a platform where you choose yourself which fund your child's money is invested in. There are many options, both good and worse ones, and you have to pick the right fund yourself. Tuleva's Additional Investment Fund has just one fund, a broad-based index fund with a fee of 0.28% per year, and we stand behind it."
msgstr "LHV Kasvukonto on platvorm, kus sa valid ise, millisesse fondi lapse raha investeeritakse. Valikuid on palju, nii häid kui kehvemaid, ja õige fondi pead ise välja valima. Tuleva Täiendavas Kogumisfondis on ainult üks fond – laiapõhjaline indeksfond tasuga 0,28% aastas – ja selle eest seisame meie."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:176
msgid "Swedbank's child products (Koolifond and its successor, the Lapse Tuleviku fund) mix investing with insurance. The total cost of such products is estimated at around 1.5% per year, and the exact amount depends on the contract. Tuleva's fund is meant for investing only. If you need insurance, that is a separate purchase."
msgstr "Swedbanki lapsetooted (Koolifond ja selle järglane Lapse Tuleviku fond) põimivad investeerimise ja kindlustuse. Selliste toodete kogutasu jääb hinnanguliselt 1,5% kanti aastas ja täpne summa sõltub lepingust. Tuleva fond on mõeldud ainult investeerimiseks – kui kindlustust vajad, on see eraldi ost."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:185
msgid "If a grandparent or another close person wants to make a contribution to your child's account, the simplest way for now is for them to gift the money to you: you transfer it to your child's account and from there to the fund. If a gift lands straight on the child's account, investing it requires the court's consent by law. That is why we recommend gifting through the parent. We are still working on a solution that would let family and friends make gifts straight to the child's savings fund account."
msgstr "Kui vanavanem või muu lähedane soovib lapse kontole sissemakse teha, on hetkel kõige lihtsam, kui ta kingib raha sulle ja sina kannad selle lapse kontole ning sealt fondi. Kui kingitus laekub otse lapse kontole, vajab selle investeerimine seaduse järgi kohtu nõusolekut – seepärast soovitamegi kinkida vanema kaudu. Töötame veel lahenduse kallal, et lähedased saaksid otse kogumisfondi kontole kingitusi teha."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:26
msgid "Contribution"
msgstr "Sissemakse"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:36 templates/child-savings-content.php:45
msgid "More information"
msgstr "Lisainfo"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:225
msgid "Should you save in the child's name or your own?"
msgstr "Kas koguda lapse või vanema nimel?"

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:226
msgid "The pros and cons of each option."
msgstr "Mis on kummagi variandi plussid ja miinused."

#: templates/child-savings-content.php:45
msgid "The calculation assumes the child sells their fund units gradually over 4 years, between ages 18 and 21, not all at once, and uses their yearly tax-free income each year. Today this is 8,400 € per year if the child has no other income. The amount is set by law and will change over the years."
msgstr "Arvestus eeldab, et laps müüb osakud järk-järgult 4 aasta jooksul vanuses 18​–​21, mitte kõik korraga, ja kasutab igal aastal oma maksuvaba tulu. Praegu on see 8400 € aastas, kui lapsel muud tulu pole. See summa on seadusega määratud ja muutub aastate jooksul."

