#: templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:103
msgid "Put your company's spare cash to work. No LEI code is needed. Suitable for private limited companies with up to two shareholders and board members."
msgstr "Pane ettevõtte vaba raha tööle. LEI koodi pole vaja. Sobib OÜ-dele, millel on kuni kaks osanikku ja juhatuse liiget."

#: templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:104
msgid "Should you invest through your company →"
msgstr "Kas investeerida OÜ kaudu →"

#: templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:110
msgid "For your child"
msgstr "Lapsele"

#: templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:111
msgid "Invest in your child's name: the assets legally belong to them. The earlier you start, the longer they have to grow."
msgstr "Investeeri lapse nimel – vara on juriidiliselt tema oma. Mida varem alustad, seda kauem jõuab see kasvada."

