#: templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:185
msgid "Stock prices can rise as well as fall over time. The fund is meant for long-term investing."
msgstr "Aktsiate hinnad võivad ajas nii kasvada kui ka kahaneda. Fond sobib pikaajaliseks investeerimiseks."

#: templates/savings-fund-landing-content.php:186
msgid "Your assets are protected."
